      "kind": "feature",
      "seconds": 5.5,
      "minSeconds": 4.5,
      "title": "1998. The porch, the sun going down.",
      "caption": "You were standing in it. The file kept one angle.",
      "narration": "A photograph has no depth. Your own server works it out.",
